Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|acajou||cashew}}, from {{der|en|tpw|akaîu}}.<ref name=OCD>Lindberg, Christine A., ed. ''The Oxford College Dictionary.'' 2nd. New York: Spark Publishing, 2007.</ref> {{doublet|en|cashew}}.

