===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[cashew]] tree. {{defdate|From the late 16th century.}}<ref name=SOED>Brown, Lesley, ed. ''The Shorter Oxford English Dictionary.'' 5th. Oxford: Oxford University Press, 2003.</ref>
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2020|translator=Betsy Wing|by=w:Édouard Glissant|title=Mahagony{{sic}}|location=Lincoln|publisher=w:University of Nebraska Press|isbn=9781496201782|pageurl=https://www.google.com.br/books/edition/Mahagony/79kDEAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=%22acajous%22&pg=PA105&printsec=frontcover|page=105|text=The head man's fury shouted out in the curve of the '''acajous'''—he insulted hunters, gendarmes, planters, and the transparent clouds lowering with the sky—before sticking the gun barrel under the chin thrust deep into solitude and a suffering that sees all.}}
